              (asset + vuln-class in-scope, per finding_gate c1)",
    is_a:    "a full V with its own S1..S5 — ¬a subsystem of its parent",
    purpose: "produces the security variety the parent needs: VALIDATED
              findings (∄ spam) + program intel canon.
              WHAT FAILS IF IT IS ABSENT: the security domain gets ∄
              S1 → the lab's design (BBH-1, 6 sections) stays a map;
              S3 alloc bargains without a security demand signal;
              the R6 empirical exercise has no unit to exercise",
  },

  substrate: {
    execution: "two LXCs — s1-bbh (105) + s1-bbh-lab (111), VLAN30
              (10.10.30.0/24); kind of unit, ¬an address",
    isolation: "VLAN30 firewall isolation — the R6 crux: no
              firewall=1 on net0, host FORWARD DROP for inter-VLAN,
              masquerade out (s1_spec §5.2 soc note — same isolation
              model); own crash domain per node; declared isolation
              must be PROVEN by the empirical exercise before any
              coupling (that IS R6)",
    services: "1 declared — bbh-prod (LXC 111, active=0 measured
              2026-08-09) + the nested tool surface (waf_detect.py,
              cve_lookup, interactsh_manager, playwright capture,
              atomization pipeline — contract §nested)",
    scale:    "one lab + one production node; the tool surface grows
