              on Stripe 2026-07-25, 5 real targets captured) +
              isolation integrity (FORWARD DROP holding)",
    omega:     "the viable set IN THIS DOMAIN — RoE-constrained action
              space: ∀ test: asset ∈ scope ∧ vuln-class ∈ scope ∧
              method ∈ permitted (RoE canon). NOT the parent's R^128",
    threshold: "a finding that fails c1 (SCOPE) ∨ c2 (PoC) is a
              violation, ¬a quality slip — the HARD BLOCK threshold;
              isolation integrity < 100% = ¬ viable (R6 clearcut)",
    measured_by: "finding_gate (c1 ∧ c2 — deterministic, both
